# ynet: the lead photo is a block <img> in an inline <a> whose own box is the 11px line under it; the ring was a strip below the photo.
https://www.ynet.co.il/
wait:5000
start:css=.slotView a:has(> img.SiteImageMedia)
key:ArrowRight
key:ArrowLeft
eval:(() => { const h = document.getElementById('tui-spotlight').getBoundingClientRect().height; if (h < 100) throw new Error('ring is ' + h + 'px tall'); return h; })()
